    "content": "Scaffolding  loop When  students  have  time  or  adopt a  mastery  orientation,  they  often  begin  with  Socratic Inquiry  and  pursue  modification,  testing,  and  explanation of AI suggestions. In CLT terms, this pattern is consistent with reduced extraneous effort (less syntax/search churn) while retaining or increasing germane processing (reasoning about structure and tests) (Debue & Van De Leemput, 2014; Gkintoni et al., 2025). It also coheres with the  literature  on  'productive  struggle'  and  productive failure:  structured  difficulty  and  delayed  direct  instruction  can  strengthen  long-term  knowledge  organization",
